-- Bao Minh erection all risks rules: Part I, material damage (src:153-242), pages 3-4.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated by tools/vnsrc.py from line N of
-- ../../source/raw/baominh-ear.txt.
--
-- WHAT THIS PART DOES. Bao Minh indemnifies sudden and unforeseen physical loss of or
-- damage to an item named in the schedule, from any cause not excluded, to an extent that
-- needs repair or replacement, during the period of insurance; plus clearance of debris if
-- a sum is stated for it. Six exclusions follow, then four articles: the sum insured and
-- average (1), the basis of settlement (2), extra charges (3), surrounding property (4).
--
-- THE ORDER OF THE ARITHMETIC. The document states the pieces but not their order (fork
-- F15). The order taken here, for one occurrence:
--   1. for each covered loss, the Article 2 basis (repair cost, or actual value for a total
--      loss), with Article 3 extra charges if agreed, less salvage, limited to what the
--      Insured actually spent (alterations excluded);
--   2. Article 1 average on that figure, item by item;
--   3. the losses on each item added together and limited to that item's sum insured;
--   4. the items added together, with clearance of debris up to its separate sum;
--   5. less the Part I deductible for the occurrence (exclusion 1);
--   6. limited to the Part I limit for any one occurrence, where the schedule states one;
--   7. limited to what remains of the total sum insured under Part I;
--   8. General Condition 9, if other insurance covers the same loss.

§ `Part I — material damage`
-- src:153 | PHẦN I - TỔN THẤT VẬT CHẤT

§§ `Which schedule item a loss falls under`

-- Article 4 requires the value of surrounding property to be stated "at Part I item 4"
-- of the schedule; Article 1 speaks of "items 1 and 2". Those are the only item numbers the
-- document gives.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 4, "tại phần I mục 4" (src:241)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the item number Article 4 gives for surrounding property` MEANS 4

GIVEN `the loss`   IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A MAYBE `An item in Part I of the schedule`
`the schedule item for` `the loss` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the loss`'s `the property`
    WHEN `part of the item numbered` OF n, k
        THEN `the item numbered` n `in` (`the policy`'s `the schedule`)
    WHEN `surrounding property` OF s, o, k
        THEN `the item numbered` `the item number Article 4 gives for surrounding property` `in` (`the policy`'s `the schedule`)

GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss under Part I`
GIVETH A `A kind of property`
`the kind of property in` `the loss` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the loss`'s `the property`
    WHEN `part of the item numbered` OF n, k THEN k
    WHEN `surrounding property` OF s, o, k   THEN k

GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss under Part I`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the loss is of surrounding property` `the loss` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the loss`'s `the property`
    WHEN `part of the item numbered` OF n, k THEN FALSE
    WHEN `surrounding property` OF s, o, k   THEN TRUE

§§ `The insuring clause`

-- "In this Part, Bao Minh agrees with the Insured that if at any time during the period of
-- insurance any item named in the schedule, or any part of it, suffers sudden and
-- unforeseen physical loss or damage from any cause other than those excluded below, to an
-- extent that repair or replacement is necessary, Bao Minh will indemnify the Insured for
-- that loss as provided below, in cash, or by repair or replacement (at Bao Minh's option),
-- the indemnity for each item named in the schedule not to exceed the sum stated against
-- that item, for each occurrence not to exceed 'that limit of indemnity', and in total not
-- to exceed the total sum insured under this Part stated in the schedule."
--
-- * Cash, repair or replacement "at Bao Minh's option": a choice the encoding does not
--   make. It computes the indemnity as a sum of money (fork F16).
-- * "that limit of indemnity" has no antecedent; read as the per-occurrence limit stated
--   in the schedule, if one is (fork F14).
-- * The per-item cap is applied per occurrence (fork F15).
-- src:155 | Trong phần này, Bảo Minh thoả thuận với Người được bảo hiểm rằng nếu vào bất kỳ lúc nào trong
-- src:156 | thời hạn bảo hiểm, một hạng mục nào đó có tên trong Phụ lục hay bất kỳ bộ phận nào của hạng
-- src:157 | mục đó bị tổn thất vật chất bất ngờ và không lường trước được do bất kỳ nguyên nhân nào khác
-- src:158 | với những nguyên nhân bị loại trừ dưới đây và với mức độ cần thiết phải sửa chữa hoặc thay thế,
-- src:159 | thì Bảo Minh sẽ bồi thường cho Người được bảo hiểm tổn thất đó theo quy định dưới đây bằng
-- src:160 | tiền, bằng cách sửa chữa, thay thế (tùy Bảo Minh lựa chọn), mức bồi thường đối với từng hạng mục
-- src:161 | ghi trong Phụ lục sẽ không vượt quá số tiền được ghi tương ứng với hạng mục đó, đối với mỗi sự
-- src:162 | cố sẽ không vượt quá hạn mức trách nhiệm bồi thường đó và tổng cộng lại, toàn bộ số tiền bồi
-- src:163 | thường không vượt quá tổng số tiền được bảo hiểm ở phần này được quy định trong Phụ lục.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I insuring clause (src:155-159)
GIVEN `the loss`  IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground on which Bao Minh is not liable`
`the Part I insuring clause does not reach` `the loss` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (BRANCH
            IF `the loss is of surrounding property` `the loss`                                  THEN EMPTY
            IF isJust (`the schedule item for` `the loss` `under` (`the claim`'s `the policy`)) THEN EMPTY
            OTHERWISE LIST `Part I: the item is not named in the schedule`),
        (IF     `the nature`'s `sudden and unforeseen`
            AND `the nature`'s `physical loss or damage`
         THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `Part I: not sudden and unforeseen physical loss or damage`),
        (IF `the nature`'s `repair or replacement necessary`
         THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `Part I: repair or replacement is not necessary`))
    WHERE `the nature` MEANS `the loss`'s `the nature`

-- The period: for part of an item, that item's cover (bm-ear-period.l4); for surrounding
-- property, Article 4's "during the period of insurance", the period of the policy. An
-- item the schedule does not name has no period of its own; the insuring clause ground
-- ("not named in the schedule") answers for it, so this test does not report it twice.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I insuring clause, "vào bất kỳ lúc nào trong thời hạn bảo hiểm" (src:155-156); Article 4 (src:240)
GIVEN `the loss`  IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the period of insurance covers` `the loss` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    IF   `the loss is of surrounding property` `the loss`
    THEN `the day` `is within the period of insurance under` `the policy` `for a liability arising from item` NOTHING
    ELSE CONSIDER `the schedule item for` `the loss` `under` `the policy`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
         WHEN JUST i  THEN `the item was on cover on` `the day` `under` `the policy` `for` i
    WHERE
        `the policy` MEANS `the claim`'s `the policy`
        `the day`    MEANS `the claim`'s `the occurrence`'s `date`

-- "Bao Minh will also indemnify the Insured for the cost of clearing the site after an
-- occurrence giving rise to a claim under this Policy, provided that a sum for it is
-- stated separately in the schedule." Read as: only where the occurrence gives rise to a
-- covered Part I loss, and up to the separate sum (fork F21).
-- src:168 | Bảo Minh cũng sẽ bồi thường cho Người được bảo hiểm chi phí dọn dẹp hiện trường sau khi xảy ra
-- src:169 | sự cố dẫn đến khiếu nại theo Đơn bảo hiểm này với điều kiện là số tiền đó phải được quy định
-- src:170 | riêng trong Phụ lục.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I, clearance of debris (src:168-170)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part I: the clearance of debris covered in` `the claim` MEANS
    IF   null (`Part I: the losses covered in` `the claim`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE CONSIDER `the claim`'s `the policy`'s `the schedule`'s `the sum stated separately for clearance of debris`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
         WHEN JUST s  THEN min (`the claim`'s `the cost of clearing debris from the site`) s

§§ `Exclusions that apply only to Part I`
-- src:172 | Điều Khoản Loại Trừ Chỉ Áp Dụng Riêng Cho Phần I
-- "However, Bao Minh will not be liable for:"
-- src:174 | Tuy nhiên, Bảo Minh sẽ không chịu trách nhiệm đối với:

-- 1. The deductible stated in the schedule, borne by the Insured in every occurrence.
--    Applied once per occurrence to the Part I total (step 5 above).
-- src:176 | 1. Mức khấu trừ quy định trong Phụ lục mà Người được bảo hiểm phải tự chịu trong mọi sự cố;
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I exclusion 1 (src:176)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part I exclusion 1: the deductible for the occurrence in` `the claim` MEANS
    `the claim`'s `the policy`'s `the schedule`'s `the Part I deductible for each occurrence`

-- 2. Consequential loss of any kind, including penalties, losses from delay, from failure
--    to perform, and loss of contract. The insuring clause covers physical loss only; the
--    sums a claim puts forward under these heads are reported, and never paid.
-- src:178 | 2. Tất cả các loại tổn thất có tính chất hậu quả, bao gồm tiền phạt, tổn thất do chậm trễ, do không
-- src:179 | đảm bảo công việc, thiệt hại hợp đồng;
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I exclusion 2 (src:178-179)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part I exclusion 2: the consequential losses excluded from` `the claim` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN l YIELD l's `the costs`'s `the consequential losses claimed`) (`the claim`'s `the losses under Part I`))

-- 3. Losses due to faulty design, defects of material or casting, or bad workmanship, but
--    not due to a fault in erection. Read as: the carve-back belongs to "bad workmanship"
--    only, so a loss that faulty design also caused is excluded even if a fault in
--    erection contributed (fork F22).
-- src:181 | 3. Những tổn thất do thiết kế sai, do khuyết tật của nguyên vật liệu hay khuôn mẫu, do tay nghề
-- src:182 | kém nhưng không phải do lỗi trong lắp đặt;
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I exclusion 3 (src:181-182)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A cause of loss`
`the causes Part I exclusion 3 lists` MEANS
    LIST `faulty design`, `defective material`, `a defective casting or mould`, `bad workmanship other than a fault in erection`

-- 4. Corrosion, wear, oxidation, scaling. The list names the conditions themselves, with
--    no "due to"; read as causes of the loss, like exclusion 3 (fork F17).
-- src:184 | 4. Ăn mòn, mài mòn, ô xy hoá, kết tạo vẩy cứng;
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I exclusion 4 (src:184)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A cause of loss`
`the causes Part I exclusion 4 lists` MEANS
    LIST `corrosion`, `wear`, `oxidation`, `scaling`

-- 5. Loss of or damage to files, drawings, accounts, bills, cash, stamps, documents,
--    evidences of debt, shares, cheques, packaging materials such as cases, crates, boxes.
--    ("vật liệu vật liệu" at src:187 repeats a word in the source.)
-- src:186 | 5. Mất mát hay thiệt hại đối với hồ sơ, sơ đồ, chứng từ kế toán, hóa đơn, tiền mặt, tem phiếu, văn
-- src:187 | bản, chứng thư nợ nần, cổ phiếu, séc, vật liệu vật liệu bao gói như hòm, thùng, hộp;
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I exclusion 5 (src:186-187)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A kind of property`
`the kinds of property Part I exclusion 5 lists` MEANS
    LIST `files`, `drawings`, `accounts`, `bills`, `currency`, `stamps`, `deeds`, `evidences of debt`,
         `share certificates`, `cheques`, `packaging materials such as cases, crates and boxes`

-- 6. Loss or damage discovered only at the time of taking an inventory.
-- src:189 | 6. Mất mát hay thiệt hại chỉ phát hiện được vào thời điểm kiểm kê.

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I exclusions 3-6 (src:181-189)
GIVEN `the loss`  IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground on which Bao Minh is not liable`
`the Part I exclusions that apply to` `the loss` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (IF `the occurrence` `was caused, directly or indirectly, by one of` `the causes Part I exclusion 3 lists`
         THEN LIST `Part I exclusion 3: faulty design, defective material or casting, or bad workmanship` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `the occurrence` `was caused, directly or indirectly, by one of` `the causes Part I exclusion 4 lists`
         THEN LIST `Part I exclusion 4: corrosion, wear, oxidation or scaling` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF elem (`the kind of property in` `the loss`) `the kinds of property Part I exclusion 5 lists`
         THEN LIST `Part I exclusion 5: files, drawings, money, securities, packaging and the like` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `the loss`'s `the nature`'s `discovered only when an inventory was taken`
         THEN LIST `Part I exclusion 6: discovered only when an inventory was taken` ELSE EMPTY))
    WHERE `the occurrence` MEANS `the claim`'s `the occurrence`

§§ `Article 4 — surrounding property`

-- "Loss of or damage to property on or near the site that is owned by, or in the care,
-- custody or control of, the principal or a contractor will be indemnified only if it is
-- directly connected with the erection or testing of the items insured under Part I and
-- occurs during the period of insurance, provided that the value of that property is
-- stated in the schedule at Part I item 4. This extension does not apply to construction
-- or erection plant and equipment."
--
-- The connection test names erection or testing, and not construction; Part II's names all
-- three (Finding 10). The period limb is applied in the period ground above.
-- src:237 | Điều 4 - Tài sản xung quanh: Tổn thất hay tổn hại đối với tài sản để tại công trường hay vùng phụ
-- src:238 | cận công trường và thuộc quyền sở hữu, bảo quản, chăm sóc hay giám sát của Chủ Đầu tư hay Chủ
-- src:239 | thầu sẽ chỉ được bồi thường nếu như tổn thất đó xảy ra có liên quan trực tiếp đến việc lắp đặt hay
-- src:240 | chạy thử các hạng mục được bảo hiểm theo phần I và xảy ra trong thời hạn bảo hiểm, với điều kiện
-- src:241 | là trị giá số tài sản đó phải được ghi trong bản phụ lục tại phần I mục 4. Phần mở rộng phạm vi bảo
-- src:242 | hiểm này không áp dụng đối với máy móc và trang thiết bị xây dựng/lắp đặt.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 4 (src:237-242)
GIVEN `the loss`  IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground on which Bao Minh is not liable`
`Article 4 does not reach` `the loss` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the loss`'s `the property`
    WHEN `part of the item numbered` OF n, k THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `surrounding property` OF `on or near`, `the principal's or a contractor's`, k THEN
        concat (LIST
            (IF `on or near` AND `the principal's or a contractor's` THEN EMPTY
             ELSE LIST `Article 4: surrounding property not on or near the site, or not the principal's or a contractor's`),
            (IF `the claim`'s `the occurrence`'s `directly connected with the erection or testing of the items insured under Part I`
             THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `Article 4: not directly connected with the erection or testing of the insured items`),
            (IF k EQUALS `construction or erection plant, machinery or equipment`
             THEN LIST `Article 4: construction or erection plant, machinery or equipment` ELSE EMPTY),
            (IF isJust (`the schedule item for` `the loss` `under` (`the claim`'s `the policy`))
             THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `Article 4: the value of the surrounding property is not stated at Part I item 4 of the schedule`))

§§ `Whether a loss is covered`

-- Every ground that defeats the loss: first those that defeat the whole claim (preamble,
-- general exclusions, General Conditions 1, 5 and 8), then the period, the end of cover on
-- an unrepaired item (General Condition 5), the insuring clause, the Part I exclusions and
-- Article 4. Covered means: no ground at all.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I (src:155-242), with the preamble, general exclusions and General Conditions
GIVEN `the loss`  IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground on which Bao Minh is not liable`
`Part I: the grounds on which Bao Minh is not liable for` `the loss` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        `the grounds that defeat the whole of` `the claim`,
        (IF `the period of insurance covers` `the loss` `in` `the claim`
         THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `period of insurance: the occurrence is outside it`),
        (IF `General Condition 5: liability for the item had ceased before` `the loss`
         THEN LIST `GC5: liability for the item had ceased, because an earlier loss was not repaired promptly and properly` ELSE EMPTY),
        `the Part I insuring clause does not reach` `the loss` `in` `the claim`,
        `the Part I exclusions that apply to` `the loss` `in` `the claim`,
        `Article 4 does not reach` `the loss` `in` `the claim`)

GIVEN `the loss`  IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Part I covers` `the loss` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    null (`Part I: the grounds on which Bao Minh is not liable for` `the loss` `in` `the claim`)

GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A loss under Part I`
`Part I: the losses covered in` `the claim` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN l YIELD `Part I covers` l `in` `the claim`) (`the claim`'s `the losses under Part I`)

§§ `Article 1 — the sum insured, and average`

-- "This insurance requires the sum insured stated in the schedule (under items 1 and 2) to
-- be not less than the full value of each item at the completion of erection, including
-- freight, customs duties, other taxes and erection costs, and the Insured undertakes to
-- increase or decrease the sum insured on fluctuations in materials, wages or prices,
-- always provided that the increase or decrease takes effect only after Bao Minh has
-- recorded it in the Policy." The undertaking is a duty in the nouns module; the recorded
-- figure is the item's `sum insured`.
-- src:193 | Điều 1 - Số tiền bảo hiểm: Loại bảo hiểm này đòi hỏi là số tiền được bảo hiểm nêu trong bản phụ
-- src:194 | lục (theo hạng mục 1 và 2) không được thấp hơn trị giá đầy đủ của mỗi hạng mục tại thời điểm
-- src:195 | hoàn thành việc lắp đặt, bao gồm cả cước phí vận chuyển, thuế hải quan, các loại thuế khác, chi phí
-- src:196 | lắp đặt và Người được bảo hiểm cam kết sẽ tăng hoặc giảm số tiền bảo hiểm trong trường hợp có
-- src:197 | sự biến động về nguyên vật liệu, lương bổng hay giá cả, luôn luôn với điều kiện là việc tăng giảm
-- src:198 | này chỉ có hiệu lực sau khi việc đó đã được Bảo Minh ghi nhận trong Đơn bảo hiểm.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 1, "theo hạng mục 1 và 2" (src:193-194)
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the items whose full value Article 1 states` MEANS LIST 1, 2

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 1 (src:193-196)
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `An item in Part I of the schedule`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 1: the sum insured is not less than the full value of` `the item` MEANS
    `the item`'s `sum insured` AT LEAST `the item`'s `full value`

-- "If at the time of a loss the sum insured is found to be less than the amount that ought
-- to have been insured, the amount recoverable is reduced in the proportion that the sum
-- insured bears to the amount that ought to have been insured. Every item and every cost
-- item is subject to this condition separately."
--
-- The amount that ought to have been insured is stated for items 1 and 2 only (paragraph 1).
-- For item 4, surrounding property, it is read as the value of that property, which
-- Article 4 requires to be stated (fork F23). For any other item the document does not say,
-- and the rule refuses (Finding 8).
-- src:200 | Trong trường hợp có tổn thất, nếu phát hiện thấy số tiền bảo hiểm thấp hơn số tiền lẽ ra phải yêu
-- src:201 | cầu bảo hiểm, thì số tiền Người được bảo hiểm được bồi thường theo Đơn bảo hiểm này sẽ giảm đi
-- src:202 | theo tỷ lệ giữa số tiền bảo hiểm chia cho số tiền lẽ ra phải yêu cầu bảo hiểm. Mọi đối tượng và
-- src:203 | khoản mục chi phí đều phải tuân theo điều kiện này một cách riêng biệt.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 1, average (src:200-203)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 1 states the amount that ought to have been insured only for items 1 and 2, and Article 4 for item 4` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 1 states the amount that ought to have been insured only for items 1 and 2, and Article 4 for item 4"

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 1, average (src:200-203)
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `An item in Part I of the schedule`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 1: the proportion of the loss recoverable on` `the item` MEANS
    IF       elem (`the item`'s `number`) `the items whose full value Article 1 states`
          OR `the item`'s `number` EQUALS `the item number Article 4 gives for surrounding property`
    THEN IF   `Article 1: the sum insured is not less than the full value of` `the item`
         THEN 1
         ELSE `the item`'s `sum insured` DIVIDED BY `the item`'s `full value`
    ELSE `Article 1 states the amount that ought to have been insured only for items 1 and 2, and Article 4 for item 4`

§§ `Article 2 — the basis of settlement`

-- "In every case of loss, the basis of settlement is: (a) for repairable loss, the cost
-- necessary to restore the damaged items to their condition immediately before the loss,
-- less salvage; or (b) for total loss, the actual value of the item immediately before the
-- occurrence, less the salvage value."
-- src:205 | Điều 2 - Cơ sở giải quyết bồi thường: Trong mọi trường hợp có tổn thất, cơ sở để giải quyết bồi
-- src:206 | thường theo Đơn bảo hiểm này là:
-- src:208 | a) Đối với trường hợp tổn thất có thể sửa chữa được - chi phí cần thiết để phục hồi các hạng
-- src:209 | mục bị tổn thất trở lại trạng thái như trước khi xảy ra tổn thất trừ đi phần thu hồi, hoặc
-- src:211 | b) Đối với trường hợp tổn thất toàn bộ - trị giá thực tế của hạng mục đó ngay trước khi xảy
-- src:212 | ra sự cố trừ đi phần trị giá thu hồi,
-- "However, only to the extent of the costs the Insured actually incurs and to the extent
-- they are included in the sum insured, and always provided these conditions and terms
-- have been complied with in full." Compliance is General Condition 1, above.
-- src:214 | Tuy nhiên, chỉ bồi thường ở mức độ chi phí mà Người được bảo hiểm thực tế phải gánh chịu và ở
-- src:215 | mức độ mà các khoản đó được tính chung trong số tiền bảo hiểm và luôn luôn với điều kiện là các
-- src:216 | điều kiện và điều khoản này đều được tuân thủ đầy đủ.
-- "Bao Minh pays only once satisfied by the invoices and documents needed to show that the
-- repair has been carried out or the replacement made. Every repairable loss must be
-- repaired, but if the cost of repair equals or exceeds the value of the item before the
-- loss, settlement is on the basis of (b)." Read with "actually incurred", a total loss is
-- paid only once the Insured has replaced the item at its own cost (Finding 9).
-- src:218 | Bảo Minh sẽ chỉ bồi thường sau khi thoả mãn với việc xuất trình các hoá đơn, chứng từ cần thiết để
-- src:219 | chứng tỏ rằng việc sửa chữa đã được tiến hành hay việc thay thế đã được thực hiện, tuỳ theo từng
-- src:220 | trường hợp cụ thể. Mọi tổn thất có thể sửa chữa được đều phải được sửa chữa, nhưng nếu chi phí
-- src:221 | sửa chữa tương đương hay vượt quá trị giá của hạng mục đó tại thời điểm trước khi xảy ra tổn thất
-- src:222 | thì việc thanh toán bồi thường sẽ được thực hiện trên cơ sở quy định ở Điểm b) trên.
-- "The cost of temporary repairs is borne by Bao Minh if it forms part of the permanent
-- repairs and does not increase the cost of repair." All or nothing (fork F24).
-- src:227 | Chi phí sửa chữa tạm thời sẽ do Bảo Minh chịu nếu như chi phí đó là một bộ phận cấu thành của
-- src:228 | việc sửa chữa chính thức và không làm tăng chi phí sửa chữa.
-- "No cost of alteration, addition and/or improvement is indemnified under this Policy."
-- src:230 | Mọi chi phí nhằm sửa đổi, bổ sung và/hoặc hoàn thiện thêm sẽ không được bồi thường theo Đơn
-- src:231 | bảo hiểm này.

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 2, temporary repairs (src:227-228)
GIVEN `the costs` IS A `The costs of a loss under Part I`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 2: the temporary repairs borne by Bao Minh in` `the costs` MEANS
    IF       `the costs`'s `the temporary repairs form part of the permanent repairs`
         AND NOT `the costs`'s `the temporary repairs increase the cost of repair`
    THEN `the costs`'s `the cost of temporary repairs`
    ELSE 0

§§ `Article 3 — extra charges`

-- "The cost of overtime, night work, work on public holidays and express freight is
-- covered by this Policy only if specially agreed in writing in advance."
-- src:233 | Điều 3 - Mở rộng phạm vi bảo hiểm: Chi phí cho việc làm thêm giờ, làm việc ban đêm, làm việc
-- src:234 | trong ngày lễ, cước phí vận chuyển hoả tốc chỉ được bảo hiểm bằng Đơn bảo hiểm này nếu như có
-- src:235 | thoả thuận riêng trước bằng văn bản.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 3 (src:233-235)
GIVEN `the costs`  IS A `The costs of a loss under Part I`
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 3: the extra charges covered in` `the costs` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    IF   `the policy`'s `extra charges under Article 3 agreed specially in writing in advance`
    THEN `the costs`'s `the extra charges for overtime, night work, work on public holidays and express freight`
    ELSE 0

§§ `The amount for one loss`

-- Article 2(a), with temporary repairs and the Article 3 charges, less the part of the cost
-- not included in the sum insured, less salvage.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 2(a) (src:208-209), with src:214-215, 227-228, 233-235
GIVEN `the costs`  IS A `The costs of a loss under Part I`
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 2(a): the repair basis for` `the costs` `under` `the policy` MEANS
      `the costs`'s `the cost of restoring the item to its condition immediately before the occurrence`
    MINUS `the costs`'s `the part of that cost of a kind not included in the sum insured`
    PLUS  `Article 2: the temporary repairs borne by Bao Minh in` `the costs`
    PLUS  `Article 3: the extra charges covered in` `the costs` `under` `the policy`
    MINUS `the costs`'s `the salvage value`

-- Article 2(b), with the Article 3 charges, less salvage.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 2(b) (src:211-212), with src:233-235
GIVEN `the costs`  IS A `The costs of a loss under Part I`
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 2(b): the total-loss basis for` `the costs` `under` `the policy` MEANS
      `the costs`'s `the actual value of the item immediately before the occurrence`
    PLUS  `Article 3: the extra charges covered in` `the costs` `under` `the policy`
    MINUS `the costs`'s `the salvage value`

-- Which basis: (a) for a repairable loss whose repair cost is below the item's value just
-- before the loss; otherwise (b). Then limited to the costs actually incurred, less any
-- alterations, and never below nothing.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 2 (src:205-231)
GIVEN `the loss`   IS A `A loss under Part I`
      `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 2: the basis of settlement for` `the loss` `under` `the policy` MEANS
    max 0 (min `the basis` `the costs actually incurred, less alterations`)
    WHERE
        `the costs` MEANS `the loss`'s `the costs`
        `the basis` MEANS
            IF       `the loss`'s `the nature`'s `repairable`
                 AND `the costs`'s `the cost of restoring the item to its condition immediately before the occurrence`
                     LESS THAN `the costs`'s `the actual value of the item immediately before the occurrence`
            THEN `Article 2(a): the repair basis for` `the costs` `under` `the policy`
            ELSE `Article 2(b): the total-loss basis for` `the costs` `under` `the policy`
        `the costs actually incurred, less alterations` MEANS
                `the costs`'s `the costs actually incurred by the Insured`
          MINUS `the costs`'s `the cost of alterations, additions or improvements`

-- Article 2's timing condition: Bao Minh pays only once the invoices are produced. This
-- says WHEN the amount is payable, not whether Bao Minh is liable for it.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I Article 2 (src:218-220)
GIVEN `the loss` IS A `A loss under Part I`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 2: payment may now be made for` `the loss` MEANS
    `the loss`'s `invoices showing the repair or replacement have been produced`

§§ `The amount for one occurrence`

-- Steps 2 and 3: average on each loss, then the losses on one item added and capped at its
-- sum insured.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I insuring clause (src:160-161); Article 1 (src:200-203)
GIVEN `the item`  IS AN `An item in Part I of the schedule`
      `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part I: the indemnity on` `the item` `in` `the claim` MEANS
    min (`the item`'s `sum insured`)
        (sum (map (GIVEN l YIELD `Article 2: the basis of settlement for` l `under` `the policy`
                                 TIMES `Article 1: the proportion of the loss recoverable on` `the item`)
                  `the covered losses on the item`))
    WHERE
        `the policy` MEANS `the claim`'s `the policy`
        `the covered losses on the item` MEANS
            filter (GIVEN l YIELD `falls under the item` l)
                   (`Part I: the losses covered in` `the claim`)
        `falls under the item` l MEANS
            CONSIDER `the schedule item for` l `under` `the policy`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST i  THEN i's `number` EQUALS `the item`'s `number`

-- Steps 4-8.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, Part I insuring clause (src:155-163), clearance of debris (src:168-170), exclusion 1 (src:176), General Condition 9 (src:148-150)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part I: the amount Bao Minh is liable to pay for` `the claim` MEANS
    `General Condition 9: Bao Minh's share, in` `the claim` `, of` `within the aggregate`
    WHERE
        `the schedule` MEANS `the claim`'s `the policy`'s `the schedule`
        `the items and debris` MEANS
                sum (map (GIVEN i YIELD `Part I: the indemnity on` i `in` `the claim`) (`the schedule`'s `the items in Part I`))
            PLUS `Part I: the clearance of debris covered in` `the claim`
        `after the deductible` MEANS
            max 0 (`the items and debris` MINUS `Part I exclusion 1: the deductible for the occurrence in` `the claim`)
        `within the occurrence limit` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the schedule`'s `the Part I limit of indemnity for any one occurrence`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `after the deductible`
            WHEN JUST m  THEN min `after the deductible` m
        `within the aggregate` MEANS
            min `within the occurrence limit`
                (max 0 (`the schedule`'s `the total sum insured under Part I`
                        MINUS `the claim`'s `the amount already paid under Part I for earlier occurrences`))
